{
  "about": "Measured Tc used to sanity-check Storm, the conventional (electron-phonon) model. Each entry carries a reliability grade, because experiments can be wrong too. Only entries with use = score enter the check score: replicated, ambient-pressure, phonon-mediated superconductors. Single reports, preprints and materials outside the training domain are shown but not scored; retracted or refuted claims are listed only to record why they are left out. Materials are matched to the training set by composition, so polymorphs of one composition are pooled (median). The check never feeds back into training.",
